    what: "#886: a Dusk Cage holding the zombie murkiron's dusksnare snared at 2.5 health -- forgeweave:captured_mob is the entity's registry id plus its full Entity#saveWithoutId tag (maintainer decision, 2026-09-02), which is what makes the released mob come back at the health it was captured at. Printed off the real capture in Issue886GameTests, gametest world coordinates and all; the tag is vanilla's own entity format and is passed through unvalidated, so a field vanilla adds or drops later never breaks this decode."
